    "long_instructions": "# Airline Satisfaction\r\n\r\nThis dataset summarizes passenger satisfaction across three airline classes.\r\n\r\n**Data Question:** How do passenger satisfaction counts compare across airline classes?\r\n\r\n1. Run the starter code and identify the `Class`, `Satisfaction`, and `Count` columns.\r\n2. Group the data by `Class` and `Satisfaction`. Use `sum()` and `unstack()` to prepare the passenger counts for plotting.\r\n3. Create a stacked bar chart with a meaningful title, axis labels, legend, and readable class labels. Run the program.\r\n4. Answer the data question using at least one specific comparison from the chart.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor to explain your code, output, or errors. Use its guidance to complete the chart yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
